  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Strengthening of Supreme Audit Institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Grant is assist the Recipient in the carrying out of the Activities -  The activities for which the Grant is given are as follows:  (a)  Strengthening of the institutional capacity of  the Recipient to carry out its mandate. (b)  Design and implementation of an internet network which will link the Recipient with the supreme audit institutions in the Participating Countries (as defined in paragraph 2.1 below) for purposes of exchanging technical information amongst said institutions and inform the population of the Participating Countries with respect to the functions and responsibilities of the Recipient and any other relevant information developed by the Recipient or any Participating Country. (c)  Strengthening of the technical capacity of the supreme audit institutions in the Participating Countries to improve the carrying out of its functions and responsibilities, said strengthening shall focus in particular in the area of expertise of each said supreme audit institution. TF027434</narrative>
  </description>
